msgstr ""
":ref:`Formatlash <data_cleaning/field-cleaning>`: matnli ma'lumotlarni "
"belgilangan ehtiyojlarga muvofiq topish va almashtirish orqali "
"standartlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:14
msgid ""
"Customizable rules ensure text data stays up-to-date, streamlined, "
"consistently formatted, and aligned with company-specific formatting "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Moslashtiriladigan qoidalar matnli ma'lumotlarning dolzarb, tartibga "
"solingan, izchil formatlangan va kompaniyaga xos formatlash talablariga mos "
