"The **Discuss** application enables communication across all of Odoo's "
"applications. To view chats and channels, or start a new message, select the "
"speech bubbles that are consistently present in the upper-right corner of "
"the database header."
msgstr ""
"**Discuss** ilovasi Odoo'ning barcha ilovalari bo'ylab muloqot qilish "
"imkonini beradi. Chatlar va kanallarni ko'rish yoki yangi xabar boshlash "
"uchun ma'lumotlar bazasi sarlavhasining yuqori o'ng burchagida doimo mavjud "
"bo'lgan nutq pufakchalarini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/discuss.rst:None
msgid "Use Discuss across other applications by clicking the speech bubbles."
msgstr ""
"Nutq pufakchalarini bosish orqali Discuss ilovasidan boshqa ilovalarda "
"foydalaning."

