msgstr "Agent ulanishi"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:55
msgid "Agents have three ways to join a call queue:"
msgstr "Agentlar qo'ng'iroq navbatiga qo'shilishning uch usuliga ega:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:57
msgid "Static agents connect automatically."
msgstr "Statik agentlar avtomatik ravishda ulanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:59
msgid "Static agents are always signed into the call queue."
msgstr "Statik agentlar har doim qo'ng'iroq navbatiga kirgan holatda bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:61
msgid ""
"Manager logs in specific agents, via the `Axivox management console <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Menejer `Axivox management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_ orqali "
"muayyan agentlarni tizimga kiritadi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:62
msgid "Agent connects to the queue in Odoo, via the **VoIP** widget."
msgstr "Agent Odoo'da **VoIP** vidjeti orqali navbatga ulanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:65
msgid "Connect to the queue through Axivox"
msgstr "Axivox orqali navbatga ulanish"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the call queue is set up and the changes are applied, a manager can log "
"into the `Axivox management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_ and "
"connect dynamic agents to the queue manually."
msgstr ""
"Qo'ng'iroq navbati sozlanib, o'zgarishlar qo'llanilgandan so'ng, menejer "
"`Axivox management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_ ga kirib, dinamik "
"agentlarni navbatga qo'lda ulashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:70
msgid ""
"To connect an agent, click :guilabel:`Queues`, located in the left-hand "
"menu. Doing so opens the :guilabel:`Queues` dashboard, with a few different "
"columns listed:"
msgstr ""
"Agentni ulash uchun chap menyuda joylashgan :guilabel:`Queues` tugmasini "
"bosing. Bu bir nechta turli ustunlar ko'rsatilgan :guilabel:`Queues` "
"boshqaruv panelini ochadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: name of the queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Name`: navbatning nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extension`: number of the extension to be dialed to reach the "
"queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Extension`: navbatga ulanish uchun teriladigan ichki raqam."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Agent Connection`: number to dial for dynamic agents to log into "
"the queue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agent Connection`: dinamik agentlar navbatga kirishi uchun "
"teriladigan raqam."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Agent disconnection`: number to dial for dynamic agents to log "
"out of the queue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agent disconnection`: dinamik agentlar navbatdan chiqishi uchun "
"teriladigan raqam."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Connected Agents`: name of agents connected to the queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Connected Agents`: navbatga ulangan agentlarning nomlari."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:79
msgid ""
"The following buttons are also available on the :guilabel:`Queues` dashboard:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Queues` boshqaruv panelida quyidagi tugmalar ham mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Connect an agent`: manually connect an agent to the queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Connect an agent`: agentni navbatga qo'lda ulash."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`Report`: run a report on the queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Report`: navbat bo'yicha hisobot yaratish."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`Delete`: delete the queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Delete`: navbatni o'chirish."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Edit`: make changes to the queue's settings."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Edit`: navbat sozlamalariga o'zgartirish kiritish."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:86
msgid ""
"When agents are connected to the queue, or are live with a customer, they "
"are displayed under the :guilabel:`Connected Agents` column."
msgstr ""
"Agentlar navbatga ulangan yoki mijoz bilan suhbatda bo'lganda, "
"ular :guilabel:`Connected Agents` ustunida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:89
msgid "If they are static agents, they **always** show up as connected."
msgstr ""
"Agar ular statik agentlar bo'lsa, ular **har doim** ulangan holda ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:91
msgid ""
"Connect an agent by clicking the orange button labeled :guilabel:`Connect an "
"agent`. Then, select the desired agent's name from the drop-down menu, and "
"click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"Agentni ulash uchun :guilabel:`Connect an agent` deb nomlangan to'q sariq "
"tugmani bosing. Keyin ochiluvchi menyudan kerakli agentning nomini tanlang "
"va :guilabel:`Connect` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:94
msgid ""
"To manually log a dynamic agent out of a call queue, navigate to the `Axivox "
"management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and "
"click :guilabel:`Queues` from the left-hand menu. Then, click the "
"green :guilabel:`Refresh` button at the top of the :guilabel:`Connected "
"agents` column. From here, click the red :guilabel:`Disconnect` button, and "
"they are immediately disconnected. This can be helpful in situations where "
"agents forget to log out at the end of the day."
msgstr ""
"Dinamik agentni qo'ng'iroq navbatidan qo'lda chiqarish uchun `Axivox "
"management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_ sahifasiga o'ting va chap "
"menyudan :guilabel:`Queues` tugmasini bosing. Keyin :guilabel:`Connected "
"agents` ustunining yuqorisidagi yashil :guilabel:`Refresh` tugmasini bosing. "
"Shu yerdan qizil :guilabel:`Disconnect` tugmasini bosing va ular darhol "
"uziladi. Bu agentlar kun oxirida tizimdan chiqishni unutgan holatlarda "
"foydali bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:None
msgid ""
"Call queue with connected agents column highlighted and connect an agent and "
"report buttons\n"
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Ulangan agentlar ustuni hamda agentni ulash va hisobot tugmalari ajratib\n"
"ko'rsatilgan qo'ng'iroq navbati."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:105
msgid "Report"
msgstr "Hisobot"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:107
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Report` to open a :guilabel:`Queue report` page that shows "
"queue activity. This report includes who connected and when when, as well as "
"what phone calls were handled by the queue.f This information is showcased "
"on a separate :guilabel:`Queue report` page."
msgstr ""
"Navbat faoliyatini ko'rsatadigan :guilabel:`Queue report` sahifasini ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Report` tugmasini bosing. Ushbu hisobot kim va qachon "
"ulanganini, shuningdek, navbat tomonidan qanday telefon qo'ng'iroqlari qayta "
"ishlanganini o'z ichiga oladi. Bu ma'lumotlar alohida :guilabel:`Queue "
"report` sahifasida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:111
msgid ""
"Set the report's date in the :guilabel:`Period` field. To pick a specific "
"date range, use the :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`to` fields. The "
"information can be organized by :guilabel:`Event type` (covered below), "
"and :guilabel:`Call ID`."
msgstr ""
"Hisobot sanasini :guilabel:`Period` maydonida belgilang. Muayyan sana "
"oralig'ini tanlash uchun :guilabel:`From` va :guilabel:`to` maydonlaridan "
"foydalaning. Ma'lumotlarni :guilabel:`Event type` (quyida yoritilgan) "
"va :guilabel:`Call ID` bo'yicha tartibga solish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:115
msgid "Generate the report by clicking :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr "Hisobotni yaratish uchun :guilabel:`Apply` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:117
msgid ""
"Each report can be exported to a :abbr:`CSV (comma separated value)` file "
"for further use and analysis, via the :guilabel:`Export to CSV` button."
msgstr ""
"Har bir hisobotni keyingi foydalanish va tahlil qilish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Export to CSV` tugmasi orqali :abbr:`CSV (comma separated "
"value)` fayliga eksport qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:120
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Event type` field is clicked, a drop-down menu appears "
"with the following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Event type` maydoni bosilganda, quyidagi variantlarga ega "
"ochiluvchi menyu paydo bo'ladi:"

