msgstr ""
":ref:`itsme® orqali <sign/security/authentication-itsme>` (Yevropa Ittifoqi, "
"Buyuk Britaniya, Norvegiya va Islandiyada mavjud)"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:105
msgid ""
"These authentication methods require :ref:`buying credits <in_app_purchase/"
"credits>`. If you do not have any credits left, authentication is skipped."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu autentifikatsiya usullari :ref:`kredit sotib olishni <in_app_purchase/"
"credits>` talab qiladi. Agar kreditlaringiz qolmagan bo'lsa, "
