"imzo qonuniga to'liq muvofiqlikni ta'minlaydi:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign/validity/angola.rst:58
msgid ""
"While Odoo Sign is broadly applicable, there are certain exceptions where "
"electronic signatures may not be suitable or legally recognized in Angola:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo Sign keng qo'llanilishi mumkin bo'lsa-da, Angolada elektron imzolar mos "
"kelmasligi yoki qonuniy tan olinmasligi mumkin bo'lgan ayrim istisnolar "
"mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign/validity/angola.rst:69
msgid ""
"The information provided on this page is for general informational purposes "
"only and does not constitute legal advice. While Odoo Sign complies with the "
"Electronic Signature Law of Angola, users should consult with legal "
"professionals to ensure specific document types and use cases meet all legal "
"requirements. Compliance with additional industry-specific regulations may "
"also be necessary."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu sahifada taqdim etilgan ma'lumotlar faqat umumiy ma'lumot berish "
"maqsadida bo'lib, yuridik maslahat hisoblanmaydi. Odoo Sign Angolaning "
"elektron imzo qonuniga muvofiq bo'lsa-da, foydalanuvchilar muayyan hujjat "
"turlari va foydalanish holatlari barcha qonuniy talablarga javob berishini "
"ta'minlash uchun yuridik mutaxassislar bilan maslahatlashishlari kerak. "
"Shuningdek, sohaga oid qo'shimcha qoidalarga rioya qilish ham zarur bo'lishi "
"mumkin."

