msgid "Legal framework for electronic signatures in Brazil"
msgstr "Braziliyada elektron imzolar uchun huquqiy asos"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign/validity/brazil.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Brazil, electronic signatures are regulated under the `Brazilian Civil "
"Code <https://webfiles-sc1.blackbaud.com/files/support/helpfiles/npoconnect-"
"qa/content/resources/attachments/brazil-law-civil-code-13.777-2018.pdf>`_ "
"and the Provisional Executive Act 2.200-2 (EA 2200) regulations. The law "
"governs transactions performed through electronic means and the use of "
"electronic signatures. The key points of the law include:"
msgstr ""
"Braziliyada elektron imzolar `Braziliya Fuqarolik kodeksi <https://webfiles-"
"sc1.blackbaud.com/files/support/helpfiles/npoconnect-qa/content/resources/"
"attachments/brazil-law-civil-code-13.777-2018.pdf>`_ va 2.200-2-sonli "
"Muvaqqat ijroiya akti (EA 2200) qoidalari asosida tartibga solinadi. Qonun "
"elektron vositalar orqali amalga oshiriladigan bitimlarni va elektron "
"imzolardan foydalanishni tartibga soladi. Qonunning asosiy bandlari "
"quyidagilarni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign/validity/brazil.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Infraestrutura de Chaves Públicas Brasileira (ICP-Brazil)**: Brazil "
"maintains its own public key infrastructure (PKI) for digital certificates "
"called “Infraestrutura de Chaves Públicas Brasileira”. These are  digital "
"signature certificates or “seals” that serve as proof of identity of an "
"individual for a certain purpose that can be used in special cases to "
"provide additional security. These certificates are issued by Certification "
"Authorities and are required by law for the signature of specific acts."
msgstr ""
"**Infraestrutura de Chaves Públicas Brasileira (ICP-Brazil)**: Braziliya "
"raqamli sertifikatlar uchun “Infraestrutura de Chaves Públicas Brasileira” "
"deb nomlangan o'zining ochiq kalitlar infratuzilmasiga (PKI) ega. Bular "
"ma'lum bir maqsadda shaxsning shaxsini tasdiqlovchi dalil sifatida xizmat "
"qiladigan raqamli imzo sertifikatlari yoki “muhrlar” bo'lib, maxsus hollarda "
"qo'shimcha xavfsizlikni ta'minlash uchun ishlatilishi mumkin. Ushbu "
"sertifikatlar sertifikatlash organlari tomonidan beriladi va muayyan "
"hujjatlarni imzolash uchun qonun bo'yicha talab qilinadi."

